    "message": "refactor(session): stop rewriting persisted tool output to shrink context (#2691)\n\n* refactor(session): remove turn-end prune and stripNonEssential\n\n* refactor(session): remove unused SessionCompaction.prune\n\n* refactor(session): remove rebuild-time microcompact\n\n* refactor(config): remove compaction.prune, MIMOCODE_DISABLE_PRUNE and pressure levels\n\n* test(session): cover legacy compacted tool rows and full history paging\n\n* test(session): type tool-result lookup in legacy compacted row test\n\n* chore(sdk): keep generated types scoped to the compaction.prune removal\n\n* test(session): opt in to legacy compaction.prune so the turn-end regression test fails on base\n\n* docs(compose): deliver lossless-session-db spec",
