      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/contents/packages%2Fcli%2Fsrc%2Fskill%2Fbuiltin%2F.bundle%2Fmimocode-docs%2Freference%2Fconfig.md?ref=6f83cd0e171b20dc5295f2e201b18326773279ff",
      "patch": "@@ -117,7 +117,6 @@ The trigger is the model's prompt capacity (`limit.input` when the provider publ\n | Key | Purpose |\n |-----|---------|\n | `compaction.auto` | Auto-compact when context full (default true) |\n-| `compaction.prune` | Prune old tool outputs (default true) |\n | `compaction.tail_turns` | Recent user turns kept verbatim (default 2) |\n | `compaction.preserve_recent_tokens` | Max recent tokens kept verbatim |\n | `compaction.reserved` | Token buffer to avoid overflow |"
    },
